{"id":"torrey:armies","source":"torrey","name":"Armies","slug":"armies","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Antiquity of — Ge 14:1-8.","refs":[["Gen",14,1,14,8]]},{"text":"Ancient, often numerous — Jos 11:4; 1Sa 13:5.","refs":[["Josh",11,4,11,4],["1Sam",13,5,13,5]]},{"text":"Of different nations often confederated — Jos 9:2; 10:5; Jdj 3:13; 1Ki 20:1.","refs":[["Josh",9,2,9,2],["Josh",10,5,10,5],["Judg",3,13,3,13],["1Kgs",20,1,20,1]]},{"text":"Troops often hired for — 1Ch 19:7; 2Ch 25:6.","refs":[["1Chr",19,7,19,7],["2Chr",25,6,25,6]]},{"text":"Bowmen and slingers. — 1Ch 12:2; Jer 4:29.","refs":[["1Chr",12,2,12,2],["Jer",4,29,4,29]]},{"text":"Spearmen or heavy troops. — Ps 68:30; Ac 23:23.","refs":[["Ps",68,30,68,30],["Acts",23,23,23,23]]},{"text":"Cavalry. — Ex 14:9; 1Ki 20:20.","refs":[["Exod",14,9,14,9],["1Kgs",20,20,20,20]]},{"text":"War chariots. — Jos 17:16; Jdj 4:3.","refs":[["Josh",17,16,17,16],["Judg",4,3,4,3]]},{"text":"Often consisted of the whole effective strength of nations — Nu 21:23; 1Sa 29:1.","refs":[["Num",21,23,21,23],["1Sam",29,1,29,1]]},{"text":"Furnished with standards — Song 6:4; Isa 10:18; Jer 4:21.","refs":[["Song",6,4,6,4],["Isa",10,18,10,18],["Jer",4,21,4,21]]},{"text":"Accompanied by beasts of burden and wagons for baggage — Jdj 7:12; 2Ki 7:7; Eze 23:2.","refs":[["Judg",7,12,7,12],["2Kgs",7,7,7,7],["Ezek",23,2,23,2]]},{"text":"Generally in three divisions — Ge 14:15; Job 1:17.","refs":[["Gen",14,15,14,15],["Job",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"Kings in person. — 2Ki 18:13; 25:1.","refs":[["2Kgs",18,13,18,13],["2Kgs",25,1,25,1]]},{"text":"Experienced captains. — 2Ki 18:17,24.","refs":[["2Kgs",18,17,18,17],["2Kgs",18,24,18,24]]},{"text":"Wings of a nation. — Isa 8:8; Jer 48:40.","refs":[["Isa",8,8,8,8],["Jer",48,40,48,40]]},{"text":"Power of Kings. — 2Ch 32:9.","refs":[["2Chr",32,9,32,9]]},{"text":"Hosts. — Jos 10:5; Jdj 8:10.","refs":[["Josh",10,5,10,5],["Judg",8,10,8,10]]},{"text":"Bands. — 2Ki 24:2; 1Ch 7:4.","refs":[["2Kgs",24,2,24,2],["1Chr",7,4,7,4]]},{"text":"Began their campaigns in the spring — 2Sa 11:1.","refs":[["2Sam",11,1,11,1]]},{"text":"Often went on foreign service — Jer 5:15; 50:3.","refs":[["Jer",5,15,5,15],["Jer",50,3,50,3]]},{"text":"Often in open line. — Hab 1:6,8.","refs":[["Hab",1,6,1,6],["Hab",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"With order and precision. — Isa 5:27; Joe 2:7,8.","refs":[["Isa",5,27,5,27],["Joel",2,7,2,7],["Joel",2,8,2,8]]},{"text":"With rapidity. — Jer 48:40; Hab 1:8.","refs":[["Jer",48,40,48,40],["Hab",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"With noise and tumult. — Isa 17:12,13; Joe 2:5.","refs":[["Isa",17,12,17,12],["Isa",17,13,17,13],["Joel",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Fighting battles. — 1Sa 17:2,3; 1Ch 19:17.","refs":[["1Sam",17,2,17,2],["1Sam",17,3,17,3],["1Chr",19,17,19,17]]},{"text":"Besieging cities. — De 20:12; Isa 29:3.","refs":[["Deut",20,12,20,12],["Isa",29,3,29,3]]},{"text":"Assaulting cities. — Jos 7:3,4; Jdj 9:45.","refs":[["Josh",7,3,7,3],["Josh",7,4,7,4],["Judg",9,45,9,45]]},{"text":"Often surprised their enemies — Jos 8:2; 2Ch 13:15; Jer 51:12.","refs":[["Josh",8,2,8,2],["2Chr",13,15,13,15],["Jer",51,12,51,12]]},{"text":"Commenced battles with a shout — 1Sa 17:20; 2Ch 13:15; Jer 51:14.","refs":[["1Sam",17,20,17,20],["2Chr",13,15,13,15],["Jer",51,14,51,14]]},{"text":"Toil and fatigue often endured by — Eze 29:18.","refs":[["Ezek",29,18,29,18]]},{"text":"Divided the spoil — Ex 15:9; Zec 14:1.","refs":[["Exod",15,9,15,9],["Zech",14,1,14,1]]},{"text":"Sent out foraging parties — 2Ki 5:2.","refs":[["2Kgs",5,2,5,2]]},{"text":"Exercised savage cruelties on the vanquished — Jer 50:42; La 5:11-13; Am 1:13.","refs":[["Jer",50,42,50,42],["Lam",5,11,5,13],["Amos",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Frequently the instrument of God’s vengeance — Isa 13:5.","refs":[["Isa",13,5,13,5]]},{"text":"In latter ages received pay — Lu 3:14; 1Co 9:7.","refs":[["Luke",3,14,3,14],["1Cor",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"In the open fields. — 2Sa 11:11; 1Ch 11:15.","refs":[["2Sam",11,11,11,11],["1Chr",11,15,11,15]]},{"text":"Before cities. — Jos 10:5; 1Sa 11:1.","refs":[["Josh",10,5,10,5],["1Sam",11,1,11,1]]},{"text":"Fear occasioned by — Nu 22:3; Jer 6:25.","refs":[["Num",22,3,22,3],["Jer",6,25,6,25]]},{"text":"Devastation occasioned by — Isa 37:18; Jer 5:17.","refs":[["Isa",37,18,37,18],["Jer",5,17,5,17]]},{"text":"Their enemies. — Ex 17:13; Jos 10:10,20; Jdj 11:33; 2Sa 18:7; 1Ki 20:21.","refs":[["Exod",17,13,17,13],["Josh",10,10,10,10],["Josh",10,20,10,20],["Judg",11,33,11,33],["2Sam",18,7,18,7],["1Kgs",20,21,20,21]]},{"text":"Themselves through divine intervention. — Jdj 7:22; 1Sa 14:15,16; 2Ch 20:23.","refs":[["Judg",7,22,7,22],["1Sam",14,15,14,15],["1Sam",14,16,14,16],["2Chr",20,23,20,23]]},{"text":"Supernatural means. — Jos 10:11; 2Ki 19:35.","refs":[["Josh",10,11,10,11],["2Kgs",19,35,19,35]]},{"text":"Brought their idols with them. — 1Ch 14:12.","refs":[["1Chr",14,12,14,12]]},{"text":"Whirlwinds. — Jer 25:32.","refs":[["Jer",25,32,25,32]]},{"text":"Waters of a river. — Isa 8:7.","refs":[["Isa",8,7,8,7]]},{"text":"Caterpillars. — Jer 51:14,27.","refs":[["Jer",51,14,51,14],["Jer",51,27,51,27]]},{"text":"Grasshoppers. — Jdj 6:3-5; 7:12.","refs":[["Judg",6,3,6,5],["Judg",7,12,7,12]]},{"text":"Locusts. — Isa 33:4; Re 9:3,7.","refs":[["Isa",33,4,33,4],["Rev",9,3,9,3],["Rev",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"Flies. — Isa 7:18,19.","refs":[["Isa",7,18,7,18],["Isa",7,19,7,19]]},{"text":"Clouds. — Eze 38:9-16.","refs":[["Ezek",38,9,38,16]]},{"text":"Overflowing torrents. — Isa 28:2; Da 11:10,26.","refs":[["Isa",28,2,28,2],["Dan",11,10,11,10],["Dan",11,26,11,26]]},{"text":"Multitudes of angels. — 1Ki 22:19; Ps 148:2; Da 4:35; Mt 26:53.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,19,22,19],["Ps",148,2,148,2],["Dan",4,35,4,35],["Matt",26,53,26,53]]},{"text":"The Church. — Da 8:10-13; Song 6:4,10.","refs":[["Dan",8,10,8,13],["Song",6,4,6,4],["Song",6,10,6,10]]},{"text":"Numerous and heavy afflictions. — Job 19:12.","refs":[["Job",19,12,19,12]]}],"refCount":119}
